                  "text": "The Governor of Osh Province of Kyrgyzistan, Mr. Naken Kasiev Kasievich (right) on a tour of Aga Khan University. The Governor also visited Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development and discussed with the faculty the role of the Institute in improving the performance of teachers through their professional development in private and government schools.'",
